cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If AnnoHub contributed to a published dataset or model, please cite it using these fields."
title: "AnnoHub: a self-hosted image annotation server for LAN-based dataset construction"
abstract: "AnnoHub packages tile cropping, multi-user annotation with per-image leases, ONNX pre-labeling, and export to YOLO, Pascal VOC, COCO, and CSV into a single Windows executable that serves a browser interface over a local network."
type: software
authors:
